text I tiptoe my way down the hallway.
text Most of the classrooms here aren't used anymore.
text They'd give a culture club one of these rooms if they applied for it, but for now they're just being left as-is.
text I sneak into one of the empty classrooms unnoticed.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG023"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s4
fi
goto 5
