		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I find a chair and sit down, placing my whole weight on it.
text Beyond the curtainless windows, I see the same sky as always.
text @[Tomoya]
text I go to the trouble of being truant and all I do is kill time...
text The air of the empty room absorbs my muttering.
text When will my life change?
text Will there come a day when it will change?
text Someone I knew said that once...
text That guy must be really effeminate, I think to myself. Then I realize I was the one who said it.
if 0 == 0
	goto s5
fi
