text I aimlessly walk down the stairs.
text A sliding door down the hallway catches my eye.
text It's the library.
text A sign that reads "Closed" hangs from the door.
text Upon closer inspection, the door is slightly ajar.
text It grabs my attention, though I couldn't say why.
