text I open the door and step inside.
text Tall bookshelves and reading tables line the room.
text A faint breeze carries the fragrance of dust and paper.
text The curtains flow and flutter as if they're breathing.
text Beyond that, I see a silhouette.
text It's a quiet female student wearing a childish hair ornament.
text The emblem on her chest shows that she's a 3rd year like me.
text For some reason, she's sitting on the floor.
text Maybe she feels sick.
text I walk closer and notice that she's immersed in a book.
text Is she playing hooky, too?
text Sunohara and I are the only ones who'd be outside the classroom at this time of day.
text She doesn't notice me and continues reading.
text But then she suddenly stops turning the pages.
text She found something.
text She takes out a pair of scissors.
text She positions the blades on a page and stops for a few seconds.
text It's almost as if she's meditating.
text And then...
text *Snip* *Snip* *Snip*
text She cuts through the book without any more hesitation.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKT01A"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s11
fi
goto 13
label s11
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 13
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 55
music BGM05A.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, wait.
text I run up to her without thinking.
sound BLM.aac
text @[Girl]
text ?
text She stops and looks at my face.
text She's barefoot for some reason.
text Her campus shoes and socks lay on the floor.
text Surrounding her is a mountain of books and a bag that probably belongs to her.
text Now that I look more closely, there's even a cushion that she brought from somewhere.
text Her glare and the relaxed way she's sitting make everything seem unbalanced.
text @[Tomoya]
text That book belongs to the library.
sound BLN.aac
text @[Girl]
text ??
text She's thinking of something.
text *Snip* *Snip* *Snip*
sound BLO.aac
text @[Girl]
text Here.
text She cuts off the corner of the page she extracted from the book and hands it to me.
sound BLP.aac
text @[Girl]
text The ones on the end taste better.
text She's talking about the paper like it's a slice of cake or meat.
text @[Tomoya]
text You eat this?
text I accept the piece of paper, but I hold it up and question her.
sound BLQ.aac
text @[Girl]
text I don't eat it. I'm not a goat.
text @[Tomoya]
text I thought so.
sound BLR.aac
text @[Girl]
text Do you want to eat paper?
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't want to eat it either.
sound BLS.aac
text @[Girl]
text You're not hungry?
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm starting to get hungry.
sound BLT.aac
text @[Girl]
text Me too.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text We're making conversation, but nothing seems to make sense.
text @[Tomoya]
text Anyway...
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't think it's good to cut up the school's books.
text It's out of character for me, but I lecture her.
text *Snip* *Snip*
text She's not listening.
sound BLU.aac
text @[Girl]
text ?
text @[Tomoya]
text Never mind. Do what you want.
text I drop the piece of paper she gave me on the floor.
text Since I'm here anyway, I glance at the books around her.
text The thickest book says "Astrophysics: From Past to Future" on the cover.
text It's one of those books where I wouldn't understand a single word.
text These books seem too specialized and expensive for a library like this.
text Looking more closely at the one she's holding, it's stamped "Property of Prefectural Library."
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text It isn't the school's book after all.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey...
text I scratch my head.
text @[Tomoya]
text Didn't your parents ever tell you to take care of public property?
sound BLV.aac
text @[Girl]
text ??
text She's deep in thought again.
text She takes a box from her bag and pops open the lid.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKT01B"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
