sound BLW.aac
text @[Girl]
text Lunch.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound BLX.aac
text @[Girl]
text Very delicious lunch.
text I didn't ask.
sound BLY.aac
text @[Girl]
text I made it myself.
sound BLZ.aac
text @[Girl]
text Today's menu is rolled omelet with soup stock, meat and potato stew, spinach, and boiled beans.
sound BM0.aac
text @[Girl]
text I'm proud of this section here.
text She points at the contents of the container.
text @[Tomoya]
text It does look good.
text If I remember correctly, no food or drink is allowed in the library.
text Never mind that, we should be in class right now.
sound BM1.aac
text @[Girl]
text Want some?
text @[Tomoya]
text Look here...
sound BM2.aac
text @[Girl]
text The one today isn't made of clay.
text @[Tomoya]
text You usually eat lunches made of clay?
sound BM3.aac
text @[Girl]
text No. You'll get a tummy ache.
sound BM4.aac
text @[Girl]
text You want to eat clay?
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't want to eat clay either.
sound BM5.aac
text @[Girl]
text You're not hungry?
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm starting to get hungry.
sound BM6.aac
text @[Girl]
text Me too.
text Our conversation isn't going anywhere and almost seems to be repeating itself.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hold on. I'm...
sound BM7.aac
text @[Girl]
text Want some?
text She looks straight into my eyes and asks me again.
sound BM8.aac
text @[Girl]
text Want some...?
text There's a hint of loneliness in her voice.
text The breeze from the window floats across her childish hair ornament.
text It makes me feel guilty for some reason.
choice Eat|Refuse
setvar intF[1089] = selected
sound 02.aac
setvar intF[1089] - 1
if intF[1089] == 0
	goto s13
fi
goto 16
label s13
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll take a little.
text She nods with a sigh of relief.
sound BM9.aac
text @[Girl]
text Let us eat.
sound BMA.aac
text @[Girl]
text Let's eat.
text She puts her hands together and bows.
sound BMB.aac
text @[Girl]
text Say "Ah."
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Hey! I can't do this! It's embarrassing and we just met!
sound BMC.aac
text @[Girl]
text ???
text She doesn't seem to understand what's embarrassing about it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Geez...
text The way this girl is acting is unworldly.
sound BMD.aac
text @[Girl]
text Um...
sound BME.aac
text @[Girl]
text But I only have one pair of chopsticks.
sound BMF.aac
text @[Girl]
text What should I do...?
text I pluck a piece of the stew and toss it into my mouth.
text I chew thoroughly.
text It's cold, but well-seasoned.
text Considering this is handmade, I think she's a great cook.
sound BMG.aac
text @[Girl]
text Oh...
text She's about to say something as she looks at my face again.
sound BMH.aac
text @[Girl]
text Good?
text @[Tomoya]
text It's okay.
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKT01C"
