text She smiles faintly.
sound BMI.aac
text @[Girl]
text Want more?
text I hear the lunch bell ring.
text In fifteen minutes, this place will be crowded with students trying to study.
text She doesn't have much in that lunch box anyway. I can't bring myself to take more.
setvar intF[416] + 1
goto 17
label 16
if intF[1089] == 1
	goto s15
fi
goto 17
label s15
text @[Tomoya]
text No thanks.
text The moment I say that, she looks at me peculiarly.
sound BMJ.aac
text @[Girl]
text You're full?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, it's not that.
text It feels strange taking lunch from someone I don't know.
text After staring at me for a while, the girl speaks up with determination.
sound BMK.aac
text @[Girl]
text Then I'll eat.
text @[Tomoya]
text You don't need to declare it each and every time...
sound BML.aac
text @[Girl]
text Let us eat.
sound BMM.aac
text @[Girl]
text Let's eat.
text She puts her hands together and bows.
sound BMN.aac
text @[Girl]
text First is the omelet.
text She cuts it in half with her chopsticks.
text *Munch* *Munch*
text *Gulp*
sound BMO.aac
text @[Girl]
text Very delicious.
sound BMP.aac
text @[Girl]
text Next is the meat and potato stew.
text She halves that, too.
text *Munch* *Munch*
text *Gulp*
sound BMQ.aac
text @[Girl]
text It's very, very delicious.
sound BMR.aac
text @[Girl]
text And next is...
text She reaches for the white rice.
sound BMS.aac
text @[Girl]
text Just kidding. Now for the pickled ume.
text She fakes me out.
sound BMT.aac
text @[Girl]
text This is hard to split...
sound BMU.aac
text @[Girl]
text So can I eat it first?
text @[Tomoya]
text Do what you want.
sound BMV.aac
text @[Girl]
text Okay.
text She picks up the small ume with her chopsticks and puts it in her mouth.
sound BMW.aac
text @[Girl]
text It's very salty.
text She says that with a straining voice.
text She takes out the seed and holds it up to me for some reason.
text Apparently, she's showing it off to me.
sound BMX.aac
text @[Girl]
text See? It's not clay.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I don't understand a single thing about her.
text I hear the lunch bell ring.
text In fifteen minutes, this place will be crowded with students trying to study.
label 17
text @[Tomoya]
text Sorry I bothered you.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG027"
