text After saying that, I turn my back to her.
sound BMY.aac
text @[Girl]
text Um...
text I know she's hesitant about saying something.
sound BMZ.aac
text @[Girl]
text See you tomorrow.
text That's all I hear.
text I raise my left hand in answer before leaving the library.
